{"id":"050030684fcc654f","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-high-degree.md","title":"High Degree","display":"df-high-degree — High Degree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-high-degree","aliases":["68-df-high-degree"],"display":"df-high-degree — High Degree","depends_on":["[[68-df-degree-jump]]","[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF","verification_status":"pending-source","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-high-degree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-high-degree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-high-degree — High Degree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4ad7581c464c34d3\" href=\"?note=4ad7581c464c34d3\" title=\"68-df-degree-jump\">68-df-degree-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"pending-source"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathbf a\\in\\mathcal D\\)</span>，度跳跃及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4ad7581c464c34d3\" href=\"?note=4ad7581c464c34d3\" title=\"68-df-degree-jump\">68-df-degree-jump</a>；度序见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"52c2209f400df1a9\" href=\"?note=52c2209f400df1a9\" title=\"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees\">68-df-partial-order-on-degrees</a>。本节点采用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span> 范围内的低高分类。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{High}\">\\(\\mathrm{High}\\)</span> 是下式定义的一元谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{High}(\\mathbf a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\land \\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{High}(\\mathbf a)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\mathbf a\\le\\mathbf0&#39;\\land \\mathbf a&#39;=\\mathbf0&#39;&#39;.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是给定短书之外保留的扩展定义。显式固定 0′ 以下的论域，使 high 的含义不依赖未声明的范围约定；所有 r.e. 度均在此范围内。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-degree-jump","status":"resolved","id":"4ad7581c464c34d3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-degree-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-partial-order-on-degrees","status":"resolved","id":"52c2209f400df1a9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-partial-order-on-degrees]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-degree-jump","status":"resolved","id":"4ad7581c464c34d3","anchor":"ref-3","targe